cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MOOP, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "MOOP: Multi-Organism Omics Platform"
abstract: >-
  A web application for exploring genome assemblies, gene sets and functional
  annotations across many organisms, with annotation search, BLAST, sequence
  retrieval, bulk export and an integrated JBrowse2 genome browser.
authors:
  - given-names: "Sofia M. C."
    family-names: Robb
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3528-5267"
repository-code: "https://github.com/srobb1/moop"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - genomics
  - genome browser
  - functional annotation
  - comparative genomics
  - JBrowse2
  - BLAST
